confirmed,FRT-20260111-0686,,Department of the Interior,DOI,,,OTHER,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"A valid Federal Migratory Bird Hunting and Conservation Stamp (Duck Stamp) is an annual licensing requirement for all migratory bird hunters.  Artwork for the stamp is chosen by a panel of judges during an annual art contest. The Duck Stamp and Junior Duck Stamp contests encourage the public to engage in the U.S. Fish and Wildlife Service’s conservation mission.  In support of directives in SO 3347, the Duck Stamp and Junior Duck Stamp programs actively engage Americans of all ages to better und",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=1018-0172,,,201811-1018-002,1018-0172,,,,
