confirmed,FRT-20260111-1179,,Department of Homeland Security,DHS,U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services,,IMMIGRATION,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"USCIS uses the data collected on this form to determine eligibility for the requested H-2B nonimmigrant petition and/or requests to extend or change nonimmigrant status.  An employer or agent uses this form to petition USCIS for an alien to temporarily enter as an H-2B nonimmigrant.  An employer or agent also uses this form to request an extension of stay or change of status on behalf of the alien worker.  The form serves the purpose of standardizing requests for nonimmigrant workers, and ensuri",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=1615-0149,,,202008-1615-026,1615-0149,,,,
