confirmed,FRT-20260111-0958,,Department of the Interior,DOI,,,OTHER,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"The Land and Water Conservation Fund Act of 1965 (LWCF Act) (54 USC §200305) was enacted to help preserve, develop, and ensure access for the public to outdoor recreation opportunities.  The LWCF Act provides funds for and authorizes Federal assistance to the States for planning, acquisition, and development of needed land and water areas and facilities.  In accordance with the LWCF Act, the National Park Service (we, NPS) administers the LWCF State Assistance Program, which provides matching gr",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=1024-0031,,,201912-1024-007,1024-0031,,,,
