confirmed,FRT-20260111-0952,,Department of Health and Human Services,HHS,Centers for Disease Control and Prevention,,BENEFITS,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"Antibiotic resistance has the potential to impact all Americans at every stage of life and CDC is working to drive aggressive action and empower the nation to comprehensively respond to these threats.  The goal of this study is to establish a network of public health laboratories to improve detection and characterization of urgent antibiotic resistant threats in healthcare-associated infections, carbapenem-resistant Enterobacteriaceae (CRE), carbapenem-resistant Pseudomonas aeruginosa (CRPA), ca",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=0920-1310,,,201912-0920-013,0920-1310,,,,
confirmed,FRT-20260111-1844,,Department of Justice,DOJ,,,LAW_ENFORCEMENT,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,This is a substantive change to request approval to conduct the Survey of State Criminal History Information Systems for yearend 2024. There is no change to the burden and minor revisions to the instrument approved for the 2022 collection.  The biennial survey of state criminal history repositories will be conducted for yearend 2022. The survey will collect data to be used as the basis for estimating the percentage of total state records that are immediately available through the FBI's Interstat,,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=1121-0312,,,202305-1121-002,1121-0312,,,,
confirmed,FRT-20260111-1047,,Department of Homeland Security,DHS,U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services,,IMMIGRATION,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"The employer’s signature on the E-Verify MOU constitutes an information collection.  E-Verify stores this information with the company’s user profile, as proof that the employer agreed to the terms and conditions of E-Verify use.  In some cases, when potential employer misuse of E-Verify is discovered, E-Verify’s Monitoring and Compliance Branch may use the employer’s signature of the MOU to assist with correcting the misuse.",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=1615-0153,,,202004-1615-004,1615-0153,,,,
