confirmed,FRT-20260111-1513,,Department of Health and Human Services,HHS,Centers for Disease Control and Prevention,,BENEFITS,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"The National Notifiable Diseases Surveillance System (NNDSS) is the nation's public health surveillance system used to monitor the occurrence and spread of nationally notifiable conditions. The NNDSS facilitates the submission and aggregation of case notification data voluntarily submitted to CDC from 60 jurisdictions including health departments in every U.S. state, New York City, Washington DC, 5 U.S. territories, and 3 freely associated states. It is the official source of statistics in the U",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=0920-0728,,,202110-0920-014,0920-0728,,,,
confirmed,FRT-20260111-2000,,Department of Health and Human Services,HHS,Centers for Disease Control and Prevention,,BENEFITS,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"The WTC Health Program is a limited healthcare program established by the James Zadroga 9/11 Health and Compensation Act of 2010. The goal of the Program is to provide monitoring and treatment to responders of the 9/11 terrorist attacks at the World Trade Center, Pentagon, and Shanksville, PA, as well as survivors in the New York City Area. The data collected contained within this OMB package are intended solely for determining eligibility and treatment.   This Revision ICR is submitted for the",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=0920-0891,,,202408-0920-004,0920-0891,,,,
confirmed,FRT-20260111-0810,,Department of Transportation,DOT,Federal Aviation Administration,,OTHER,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"Airport owners and managers (sponsors) are required to report this information on occasion to the FAA in order to receive grant funds. The collected information consists of airport demographics (runway data; lighting data; enplanement data, etc.) and financial and compliance information.  This information is received and used by the FAA for grant awarding and monitoring purposes and for ensuring compliance with enabling legislation and grant assurances. This is a mandatory reporting collection f",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=2120-0569,,,201905-2120-005,2120-0569,,,,
