confirmed,FRT-20260111-2060,,Department of Transportation,DOT,Federal Aviation Administration,,OTHER,facial_recognition,biometric,PRA_ONLY,False,False,True,,,"14 CFR part 65 prescribes, among other things, rules governing the issuance of certificates and associated ratings for mechanics, repairmen, parachute riggers, and the issuance and renewal of inspection authorizations.   The information is collected on forms submitted by applicants for mechanic, repairman, or parachute rigger certificates, or applicants for an initial or renewed inspection authorization.  The information is used for evaluation by the FAA and is necessary for determining eligibil",,,https://www.reginfo.gov/public/do/PRASearch?icRef=2120-0022,,,202502-2120-002,2120-0022,,,,
